    "Every day you have logged is kept. Premium shows it as months, with your patterns and a recap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every day you have logged is kept. Premium shows it as months, with your patterns and a recap."
          }
        },
        "es-419": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se guardan todos los días que registraste. Premium los muestra mes a mes, con tus patrones y un resumen."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Каждый записанный день сохраняется. Premium показывает их по месяцам — с вашими привычками и итогами."
          }
        },
        "uz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yozilgan har bir kun saqlanadi. Premium ularni oylar bo‘yicha, odatlaringiz va xulosa bilan ko‘rsatadi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
